CONTROLBAR:TempDescription
US: "Please take the time to fill out my description located in CommandButton.ini! Thanks a bunch."
DE: "Bitte nimm dir die Zeit und fülle meine Beschreibung in CommandButton.ini aus! Danke!"
FR: "Merci de prendre le temps de remplir ma description située dans le fichier CommandButton.ini !"
ES: "Please take the time to fill out my description located in CommandButton.ini! Thanks a bunch"
IT: "Please take the time to fill out my description located in CommandButton.ini! Thanks a bunch"
KO: "CommandButton.ini에 있는 my description을 채워 주십시오."
ZH: "請花些時間將我的位置描述在CommandButton.ini中！非常感謝"
BP: "Please take the time to fill out my description located in CommandButton.ini! Thanks a bunch."
PL: "Please take the time to fill out my description located in CommandButton.ini! Thanks a bunch."
END

CONTROLBAR:CleanupAreaDescription
US: "Automatically cleans up bio toxins and radiation in area surrounding target location."
DE: "Reinigt das Zielgebiet von chemischen Kampfstoffen und Strahlung."
FR: "Elimine toute toxine bactériologique ou radiation des environs de la zone cible."
ES: "Limpia automáticamente biotoxinas y radiaciones en el área que rodea el objetivo."
IT: "Elimina automaticamente le biotossine e le radiazioni nell'area circostante il bersaglio."
KO: "목표 지역의 독소와 방사능을 자동으로 제거합니다."
ZH: "自動清除在目標區域四周的生化毒劑和輻射線。"
BP: "Limpa automaticamente as toxinas biológicas e radiação na área escolhida."
PL: "Automatycznie likwiduje skażenie mikrobiologiczne i promieniotwórcze we wskazanej okolicy."
END

