CONTROLBAR:ToolTipSwitchToUSAFlashBang
US: "Use Flash-Bang grenades"
DE: "Schaltet in den Blendgranaten-Modus um."
FR: "Pour utiliser les grenades flash."
ES: "Usa granadas cegadoras."
IT: "Usa granate flash."
KO: "섬광폭음탄을 사용합니다."
ZH: "使用閃光彈。"
